    VPLAY-8905  AAMP TSB - Trickmodes ff to live SLD
    
    Reason for change: - For SLD, while running L2 tests, the
    player freezes while tranistioning from ff to live. This is because
    seek position use current time clock, while the L2 test streams
    are harvested sometime back, leading to freeze.
    
    The solution is to use steady clock instead of current time clock.
    
    This commit also fixes a bug, wherein during forward trick play,
    tsb content available at the time of trick play was being considered.
    Content downloaded after initiating trick play was not taken into account.
    
    The solution is to calculate a delta at the tune based on steady clock,
    live offset and latest time period. When the trick play is requested,
    the position at which EOS is requested is based on delta calcuated at
    tune, live offset and trick mode speed.
    
    Test Procedure: Mentioned in the ticket
    
    Risks: - Medium
    
    Signed-off by: - Himanshu Thakkar<hthakkar@synamedia.com>
    
    Change-Id: I35208428aa6a4d8d99f28a28124d82724c397ed1

